# Shell scripts must stay LF so they execute inside Linux containers
# when cloned on Windows with core.autocrlf=true.
*.sh text eol=lf
workspace/entrypoint.sh text eol=lf

# Python hook files are invoked by .sh hooks with path substitution;
# CRLF in either the .sh OR the .py file breaks the hook dispatch.
# See #507 — SessionStart hook failed silently,
# agents returned "(no response generated)" on every A2A call.
*.py text eol=lf

# Dockerfiles and compose files are parsed by tools that tolerate CRLF,
# but keep LF for consistency across platforms.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf

# Snapshot golden files — workspace/tests/snapshots/*.txt is consumed by
# byte-exact comparisons in test_platform_tools.py. A Windows contributor
# with auto-CRLF=true would otherwise convert \n → \r\n on checkout, the
# snapshot tests would fail mysteriously locally / pass in CI (or vice
# versa), and the regen instructions in the test-file header would
# produce LF files that disagree with the working-copy CRLF versions.
workspace/tests/snapshots/*.txt text eol=lf

# Byte-exact drift/golden gates on JSON + generated OpenAPI. The rules above pin
# *.sh, *.py, Dockerfile and the workspace snapshots, but three more artifacts
# are compared byte-for-byte and were left unpinned:
#   * workspace-server/internal/cronspec/testdata/fixtures.json is a byte-for-byte
#     mirror of molecule-ai-sdk contracts/cron/fixtures.json, gated by a RAW
#     `diff -u` in .gitea/workflows/cron-fixtures-ssot-drift.yml (no JSON
#     canonicalization, so it is newline-sensitive).
#   * canvas/.../external-connection.golden.json is regenerated by
#     `MOLECULE_UPDATE_GOLDEN=1 go test` and then checked with
#     `git diff --exit-code` in .gitea/workflows/e2e-external-connect-snippet.yml.
#   * workspace-server/docs/openapi/ is regenerated by `make openapi-spec` and
#     checked with `git diff --exit-code` by the openapi-spec-check target.
# A CRLF blob or checkout makes each of those diffs fire on newlines alone.
workspace-server/internal/cronspec/testdata/fixtures.json text eol=lf
canvas/src/components/__tests__/__fixtures__/external-connection.golden.json text eol=lf
workspace-server/docs/openapi/** text eol=lf
